From 35b44bfe0cd5982f3210034e894f1b8882c8f80a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chiro <chiro2001@163.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 03:50:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 202/254] fix(tools): C7 state-swap injection must honour
 per-kind HF cache dtype

HF w8a8 cache stores conv_state/key_cache/value_cache as bf16 but
recurrent_state as float32. The first self-check cast every state to the
model param dtype (bf16), truncating the fp32 recurrent state and making
the injected-state forward differ from the sequential one. inject() now
uses the per-kind dtype recorded in the gold dump manifest; add
analyze_state_compare.py and the state comparison summary.
